    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Geringi?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GERINGI is a stylized open world survival horror game by a solo developer where you explore a post apocalyptic world that has been invaded by creatures that arrived 10 years ago with a mysterious fog.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story revolves around David, a survivor of the apocalypse, and Wes, a mysterious young boy who lost his legs in an attack before David met him and took him in. Together, they embark on a road trip to Blackridge, a rumored safe haven where the remaining survivors can live in peace.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous weapons to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies to fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camps to raid and loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ Hours of exploration, main story, side missions and different activities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cover art by Ezgi Candemir</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Geringi?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GERINGI is a stylized open world survival horror game by a solo developer where you explore a post apocalyptic world that has been invaded by creatures that arrived 10 years ago with a mysterious fog.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story revolves around David, a survivor of the apocalypse, and Wes, a mysterious young boy who lost his legs in an attack before David met him and took him in. Together, they embark on a road trip to Blackridge, a rumored safe haven where the remaining survivors can live in peace.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous weapons to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies to fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camps to raid and loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ Hours of exploration, main story, side missions and different activities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cover art by Ezgi Candemir</p>",
